{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch as our hero takes on a powerful forest beast in real-time combat! In <i>Galactic Heroes: The Enchanted Forest</i>, every encounter counts \u2014 use your reflexes and skills to defeat enemies, survive tough battles, and clear the level. With each fight, you get one step closer to restoring balance to the enchanted world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/daee9d0c9093528bab42bf1e3dfef445.poster.avif?t=1760204338\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/daee9d0c9093528bab42bf1e3dfef445.webm?t=1760204338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/daee9d0c9093528bab42bf1e3dfef445.mp4?t=1760204338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc0e Ride into Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mount up and dominate the battlefield! In Galactic Heroes: The Enchanted Forest, riding animals isn't just for travel \u2014 it's a powerful tool in combat and strategy. Whether you\u2019re charging into enemy lines or chasing down elusive foes, mounted units bring speed, strength, and style to your adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each rideable creature has unique advantages.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/e26e40355efd970e2335fd2bddabcf22.poster.avif?t=1760204338\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/e26e40355efd970e2335fd2bddabcf22.webm?t=1760204338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/e26e40355efd970e2335fd2bddabcf22.mp4?t=1760204338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2764\ufe0f United in Battle: Meet Luna</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not<strong> all heroes walk alone. In <i>Galactic Heroes: The Enchanted Forest</i>, the journey is shared. Luna, the hero\u2019s loyal companion and love interest, fights alongside you as you both venture deep into the forest\u2019s mysteries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together, you\u2019ll face powerful enemies, uncover hidden secrets, and protect each other in the face of danger. Their bond isn\u2019t just emotional \u2014 it\u2019s tactical, with coordinated attacks and teamwork that turn the tide of battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/f5505f19e3e3234c4514cc8455899f42.poster.avif?t=1760204338\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/f5505f19e3e3234c4514cc8455899f42.webm?t=1760204338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/extras/f5505f19e3e3234c4514cc8455899f42.mp4?t=1760204338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122500?t=1760204338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122500?t=1760204338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/1ed6bffc5679445cd205e0264a97b8bea1a9de04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760204338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122500/1ed6bffc5679445cd205e0264a97b8bea1a9de04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760204338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Turn Notifications","id":32},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"**\"Galactic Heroes Chapter 1\"** provides a family-friendly fantasy experience with the following characteristics:\r\n\r\n- **Fantasy Violence**: The game includes cartoonish, exaggerated battles that are not graphic. There is no realistic depiction of blood, gore, or severe injury. The violence is presented in a fantastical and non-threatening manner.\r\n- **Language**: Mild profanity or swearing may be used in dialogue, but the language is generally tame and not explicit.\r\n- **No Sexual Content**: The game does not feature any sexual acts, nudity, or sexual innuendo. There is no explicit content or suggestive themes.\r\n- **No Sensitive Topics**: The game avoids sensitive issues such as sexual assault, drug or alcohol abuse, and self-harm. It maintains a light-hearted, adventurous tone throughout.\r\n\r\n**In addition**, \"Galactic Heroes Chapter 1\" features engaging puzzles and in-game trailers:\r\n- **Puzzles**: These are integrated into the gameplay, providing challenges and interactive elements that are central to the game\u2019s progression.\r\n- **In-Game Trailers**: Available through specific sections or menus within the game, these trailers offer additional insight into the game\u2019s content and features.\r\n\r\nThis description ensures that customers are well-informed about the nature of the content and the overall experience offered by the game."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch as our hero takes on a powerful forest beast in real-time combat! In <i>Galactic Heroes: The 